---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import reformers from "../../assets/work/articles/sclpt-reformers.jpg";
import mats from "../../assets/work/articles/sclpt-mats.jpg";

const tags = ["Pilates", "Health and Wellness", "Athens", "Fitness", "Business"];
---

<Base
  title="SCLPT Studio brings boutique wellness to Athens | Grace Joy Park"
  description="Grace Joy Park's beat story on Athens boutique fitness studio SCLPT, co-founded by Alexis Cason and Genna Ringler."
>
  <p class="back"><a href="/work">&larr; Back to Writing</a></p>

  <article class="post">
    <h1>SCLPT Studio brings boutique wellness to Athens</h1>
    <p class="meta muted">Reporting I, Grady College &middot; March 30, 2026 &middot; By Grace Park</p>

    <ul class="tags">
      {tags.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}
    </ul>

    <figure class="hero">
      <Image
        src={reformers}
        alt="Reformer machines line the studio floor at SCLPT Studio"
        widths={[600, 900, 1200, 1600]}
        sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 900px"
        format="webp"
      />
      <figcaption>
        Reformer machines line the studio floor at SCLPT Studio in Athens, Ga. The boutique
        fitness studio, co-founded by Alexis Cason and Genna Ringler, offers both reformer
        Pilates and hot mat sculpt classes to members. (Photo/Grace Park)
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">
        SCLPT Studio brought something new to Athens, a boutique fitness studio combining
        reformer Pilates and hot mat sculpt classes under one roof. Co-founders Alexis
        Cason and Genna Ringler opened the studio one year ago, and it has already hit
        maximum capacity.
      </p>
      <p>
        The two co-founders identified a gap: Athens had no studio combining reformer
        Pilates and hot mat sculpt classes under one roof, so they built one. The idea
        took shape after both women independently visited the same heated mat Pilates
        studio in New York City within a week of each other.
      </p>
      <p>
        &ldquo;I believe we&rsquo;re actually one of the only studios in Georgia that
        offers hot mat sculpt classes and reformers in the same studio,&rdquo; Ringler
        said. SCLPT now runs 13 to 17 classes on a typical weekday, and nearly every
        one fills a waitlist. The studio paused new memberships temporarily to protect
        the experience for existing clients.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="secondary">
      <Image
        src={mats}
        alt="Hot mat sculpt room at SCLPT Studio"
        widths={[600, 900, 1200, 1600]}
        sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 900px"
        format="webp"
      />
      <figcaption>
        Mats line the floor of the hot mat sculpt room at SCLPT Studio in Athens, Ga.
        Co-founders Alexis Cason and Genna Ringler say the heated mat class offering
        sets the studio apart from other fitness studios in the area. (Photo/Grace Park)
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p class="full-link">
      <a href="/work/sclpt-studio.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Read the full story (PDF) &rarr;
      </a>
    </p>

    <section class="why-section">
      <h2>Why I Wrote The Story</h2>
      <p>
        A boutique studio hitting maximum capacity in its first year is a real Athens
        business story, especially one led by two young women in a college town that
        doesn&rsquo;t track that kind of growth. Reporting it pushed me to interview two
        co-founders at once, hold a profit-versus-mission thread and let their philosophy
        on mental health do the work instead of leaning on adjectives. It also strengthened
        my business beat by giving me a recurring source set I can return to as the studio
        scales.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .back { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .post h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .meta {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tags {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .tags li {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .hero, .secondary {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .secondary {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .hero :global(img),
  .secondary :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .hero figcaption,
  .secondary figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .prose p {
    max-width: 65ch;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .prose .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .full-link {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .why-section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .why-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .why-section p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
